{"id":"5e2485d60abdf08e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-TB-plus.md","title":"TB^+理论 (Typed Truth over Base with Induction)","display":"df-TB-plus — TB^+理论 (Typed Truth over Base with Induction)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-TB-plus","aliases":["91-df-TB-plus","91-df-TB^+"],"display":"df-TB-plus — TB^+理论 (Typed Truth over Base with Induction)","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-TB-plus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-TB-plus</span><span>91-df-TB^+</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-TB-plus — TB^+理论 (Typed Truth over Base with Induction)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-TB-plus-—-TB^+理论-$\\mathrm{TB}^+$\">df-TB-plus — TB^+理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}^+\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}^+\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> (类型真理理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}\\)</span> (扩展语言的归纳模式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (扩展语言中的经典演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}TB\\text{-}plus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TB}^{+}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{TB}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}^+\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}^+\\)</span> : TB^+理论（带真理归纳的类型真理理论）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>：允许含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公式的完整一阶归纳模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：TB^+是在TB上加入对整个扩展语言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span>的普通归纳模式；它不是把“所有实例都真”直接当作对象语言推理规则。</p>\n<p>与TB的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TB是PA的保守扩张（不能证明新算术命题）</li>\n<li>TB^+是否保守取决于真理归纳的具体形式</li>\n<li>TB^+提供更强的真理推理能力，但仍保持类型化结构</li>\n</ul>\n<p>TB与UTB的差异来自逐句双条件式和统一双条件式，而不是由“是否无类型”划分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-TB-plus-—-TB^+理论-$\\mathrm{TB}^+$","text":"df-TB-plus — TB^+理论 $\\mathrm{TB}^+$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","sta